WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:03.086
The thing about directing is,
time is ticking,

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.838
and you've gotta
wrangle the actors.

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:05.755
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:07.841
-CHERYL DAVID: Well...
-LARRY DAVID: Hey.

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:09.467
-I am glad you're here.
-Are you?

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:12.095
Never thought I'd hear those
words come out of your mouth.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:15.181
So, this season,
I'm directing episode three.

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:17.976
And it came to be
because Larry called me

00:00:18.059 --> 00:00:21.020
and asked me if I was interested
in directing

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:22.272
one of the episodes this year.

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:24.482
I'm with a bunch of stiffs,
the food sucks,

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:26.901
the drinks aren't strong enough,
and your hand is up my ass.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.279
CHERYL HINES:
 It was really amazing

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.697
seeing the whole world of it.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.657
Because I got to hang out
with the crew.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:35.702
Some of the crew I--
I really didn't know very well.

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:37.704
And then by the end
of the shoot, it's like,

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:40.457
I'd rather be hanging out
with the camera truck

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.085
than act crafty with those
nutballs. (LAUGHS)

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:45.837
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

